以下是修改後的 SQL 建議，可以一次取得你想要的三個數字：
推薦寫法（一次查詢就拿到所有統計）
WITH PURE_TS AS
(
    SELECT CustomerNo    
    FROM VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT
    EXCEPT
    SELECT a.CustomerNo    
    FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
    JOIN CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP b ON a.cif_key = b.NEW_CIF_KEY
)
, CompareData AS (
    SELECT
        p.CustomerNo,
        v.IsSARFiled AS VERIFY_IsSARFiled,
        b.IsSARFiled AS BSA_IsSARFiled,
        CASE
            WHEN ISNULL(CAST(v.IsSARFiled AS INT),0) = ISNULL(CAST(b.IsSARFiled AS INT),0)
            THEN 'Same'
            ELSE 'Different'
        END AS CompareResult
    FROM PURE_TS p
    LEFT JOIN VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT v ON p.CustomerNo = v.CustomerNo
    LEFT JOIN BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b ON p.CustomerNo = b.CustomerNo
)
SELECT 
    COUNT(*) AS Total_Count,
    SUM(CASE WHEN CompareResult = 'Same'     THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS Same_Count,
    SUM(CASE WHEN CompareResult = 'Different' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS Different_Count
FROM CompareData;

如果你想分開跑三個獨立的查詢，也可以這樣寫：
1. 總共有幾個
WITH PURE_TS AS
(
    SELECT CustomerNo    
    FROM VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT
    EXCEPT
    SELECT a.CustomerNo    
    FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
    JOIN CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP b ON a.cif_key = b.NEW_CIF_KEY
)
SELECT COUNT(*) AS Total_Count FROM PURE_TS;
2. 一樣的有幾個
WITH PURE_TS AS
(
    SELECT CustomerNo    
    FROM VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT
    EXCEPT
    SELECT a.CustomerNo    
    FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
    JOIN CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP b ON a.cif_key = b.NEW_CIF_KEY
)
SELECT COUNT(*) AS Same_Count
FROM PURE_TS p
LEFT JOIN VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT v ON p.CustomerNo = v.CustomerNo
LEFT JOIN BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b ON p.CustomerNo = b.CustomerNo
WHERE ISNULL(CAST(v.IsSARFiled AS INT),0) = ISNULL(CAST(b.IsSARFiled AS INT),0);
3. 不一樣的有幾個
WITH PURE_TS AS
(
    SELECT CustomerNo    
    FROM VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT
    EXCEPT
    SELECT a.CustomerNo    
    FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
    JOIN CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP b ON a.cif_key = b.NEW_CIF_KEY
)
SELECT COUNT(*) AS Different_Count
FROM PURE_TS p
LEFT JOIN VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT v ON p.CustomerNo = v.CustomerNo
LEFT JOIN BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b ON p.CustomerNo = b.CustomerNo
WHERE ISNULL(CAST(v.IsSARFiled AS INT),0) <> ISNULL(CAST(b.IsSARFiled AS INT),0);

小建議：
	•	第一種「一次查詢」的方式最有效率（只掃一次資料）。
	•	如果資料量很大，可以先把 PURE_TS 結果存成 temp table 再統計，會更快。
	•	需要我幫你把這三個數字再加上 CustomerNo 清單（方便查問題）也可以告訴我。
需要調整或再加其他欄位嗎？
